  "bodyHash": "poiA+C8QUX4=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"来自 Serilum 的模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">树木收割者是一个可配置的模组，允许通过砍伐树根的一个方块来瞬间收割树木、诡异树木和巨型蘑菇。这可以是树木的任何部分。树苗会自动使用树木掉落的物品进行替换。模组内置了许多检测机制，从防止意外砍伐由原木建造的房屋，到控制哪些树叶应该凋落。<br><br>默认情况下，收割仅在玩家按住潜行键时生效，但可以在配置中切换。更多功能示例见下方。模组提供了大量配置选项，方便你按喜好进行调整。<br><br>该模组可与我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">矿石收割者</a> 模组配合使用。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>默认配置下的功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>所有树木，包括原版和模组添加的，都可以通过潜行并砍伐一个方块快速收割。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>砍伐一棵树所需的时间取决于其中的原木数量。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>收割树木后，树叶会非常快速地凋落。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>在最后一片树叶凋落后，树苗会被自动替换。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>下界中的诡异树木可以快速收割。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>巨型蘑菇也可以快速收割。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>可以通过黑名单将特定类型的斧头排除在树木收割之外。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>多种检测机制判断什么是树木，什么不是。不会意外破坏房屋。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>当两种树木相邻时，只有被砍伐树木的树叶会凋落。<br><strong>◉ &nbsp; </strong>兼容其他模组。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，树木收割仅在玩家主手持有斧头时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，树木收割在不按住潜行键时生效。禁用时则相反，仅在潜行时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否让模组尝试找到树木实际最底部的原木并从此开始。这意味着你可以从中间砍断一棵树，它仍然会被完全砍倒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，被砍伐树木周围的树叶会快速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，下界的诡异菌柄/绯红菌树也会被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，巨型蘑菇也会被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，包含由玩家放置树叶的树木不会被破坏。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，收割树木时自动从掉落物中替换树苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，当 'enableHugeMushrooms' 启用且收割巨型蘑菇时，自动从掉落物中替换蘑菇。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，每收割一个原木，持有的斧头会消耗耐久。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此处可设置砍伐一棵树应该消耗斧头的多少耐久。例如设置为 0.1，则表示每 10 个原木消耗 1 点耐久。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，玩家每收割一个原木，饥饿度消耗增加 0.005（Minecraft 原版每破坏一个方块的默认值）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此项决定每收割一个原木为玩家增加多少饥饿度消耗。默认值为 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，收割时间会随树木中现有原木数量增加。增加量由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier' 决定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.1，最小值 0.01，最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerLog' 后，收割一棵树需要花费的额外时间。实际速度为：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 3，最小值 1，最大值 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">树木被收割后，每 tick 应破坏多少片树叶。增加此数值将加快树叶快速凋落速度，但每 tick 消耗更多处理性能。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧头黑名单功能：</strong></span><br>可以仅允许特定类型的斧头收割树木。模组首次加载时会生成一个黑名单文件。位于 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能同样适用于模组添加的斧头物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>收割一棵白桦树（旁边是橡树）。只有白桦树叶在凋落：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵大橡树：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 云杉树。砍伐这棵树所需时间更长，并且所有 4 棵树苗都被正确替换：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于诡异（下界）树木：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>也适用于巨型蘑菇，这是一个棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>还有一个红色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，只要下载文件仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
